abstract: "Exploratory documentary reconstructibility audit of a fixed historical corpus. Version v1.4.0 integrates locked declared human source-linked follow-up returns for 109 positions already in the 663-position frame. All 57 historical positive positions are confirmed across the two exercises; four new sampled positives and 13 incompletely examined scopes enter a new cumulative integration. Historical inputs and results remain separately reproducible. No clinical treatment-effect analysis, external validation or uniform historical cutoff version certification is claimed."
